abstract: >-
  SeaSCAPE (Seabed Shipwreck Classification Assessment and Preservation
  Evaluation) is an open-source ArcGIS Pro toolbox for the automated
  detection and structural preservation assessment of shipwreck sites
  from high-resolution bathymetric survey data. It implements a
  two-stage workflow: derivative generation from bathymetry, followed
  by variable-threshold detection, cluster analysis, and a four-class
  preservation classification scheme.
